## English Short Summary (For International Users)

Starting from version 1.10.0, Wepps platform is no longer licensed under the MIT
License. All rights are owned by PETROFFS LLC (Russia).

- **Wepps Community:** 100% FREE for individual developers, freelancers,
  educational, and non-commercial projects. Provided "AS IS", without warranties.
- **Wepps Commercial & Enterprise:** Mandatory for corporate, commercial, and
  government use. Requires a formal contract with PETROFFS LLC.

Official licensing page and contacts: https://wepps.dev